An alert is open for a Atlas project you belong to:

Project Name: MOS
Organization Name: Brandon&#x27;s Org - 2025-08-26
Alert: Host has index suggestions 
Created: 2026/01/01 23:17 GMT

What does this mean?
The ratio of documents scanned to returned exceeded 8000 at some point over the past 24 hours on ac-ncoxder-shard-00-01.tiixipi.mongodb.net, which typically suggests that un-indexed queries are being run.
 Analysis took into consideration all existing indexes as of Thu Jan 01 04:51:39 GMT 2026. 


Suggested actions:
* Clients are performing queries that are not covered by indexes.
* Analysis took into consideration all existing indexes as of Thu Jan 01 04:51:39 GMT 2026. 
* Data size (number of documents in queried collection) has grown.
* Query is not well targeted (e.g. indexes are on low-cardinality fields or query is malformed).


